/* 江可妮：印记模块原创纸张风格；与搜索模块保持同一视觉语言，不引入外部字体或组件库。 */
.notebook {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 32rpx 28rpx 64rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #f7f3e8;
  color: #302d28;
  font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
}
.eyebrow { font-size: 22rpx; letter-spacing: 2rpx; color: #6c6c61; }
.heading { margin: 12rpx 0 6rpx; font-size: 46rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
.marker { padding: 0 8rpx; background: #f2e4ad; border-radius: 6rpx; }
.subtitle { margin-bottom: 28rpx; color: #6c6c61; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.paper {
  background: #fffdf6;
  border: 2rpx solid #4d5146;
  border-radius: 22rpx 12rpx 20rpx 14rpx;
  box-shadow: 5rpx 6rpx 0 #d8decf;
}
.button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  min-height: 84rpx;
  background: #fffdf6;
  color: #302d28;
  border: 2rpx solid #4d5146;
  border-radius: 16rpx 10rpx 18rpx 12rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.button.primary { background: #dce7cf; font-weight: 600; }
.button.danger { background: #f7e3dc; color: #8c3b28; }
.button[disabled] { color: #777970; background: #e9e9df; }
.button::after, .chip::after, .post-card::after, .link-button::after { border: 0; }
.button:active, .chip:active { transform: translateY(2rpx); }
.chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 0 12rpx 12rpx 0;
  padding: 10rpx 24rpx;
  min-height: 64rpx;
  background: #fffdf6;
  color: #504d46;
  border: 2rpx solid #9aa08f;
  border-radius: 14rpx 8rpx 14rpx 8rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.chip.selected { background: #dce7cf; border-color: #4d5146; color: #26301f; font-weight: 600; }
.field-label { margin-bottom: 12rpx; font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 600; color: #3f423a; }
.muted { color: #6c6c61; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.error { color: #a03e2c; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 1.6; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.feedback { margin-top: 16rpx; }
.link-button {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 12rpx;
  background: transparent;
  color: #506346;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
.post-card {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  margin: 0 0 24rpx;
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: inherit;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.post-image { display: block; width: 100%; height: 320rpx; background: #e9e9df; }
.post-body { padding: 24rpx; }
.post-meta { margin-bottom: 10rpx; color: #6c6c61; font-size: 23rpx; }
.post-title { margin-bottom: 10rpx; color: #2d3029; font-size: 34rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; }
.post-content { color: #4a4a42; font-size: 27rpx; line-height: 1.7; }
.post-tags { margin-top: 14rpx; }
.inline-tag { margin-right: 16rpx; color: #506346; font-size: 24rpx; }
.post-footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 18rpx;
  padding-top: 14rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx dashed #cdd2c5;
  color: #6c6c61;
  font-size: 23rpx;
}
.state { padding: 40rpx 28rpx; margin-bottom: 24rpx; }
.more { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 24rpx; }
.end-note { padding: 20rpx 0; text-align: center; color: #8b8c80; font-size: 23rpx; }
